// selfhost/tests/test_basic.ydv
// Tests basic process declarations, immutable binding, emit, and yield.

process calculate⦅int64 a ⸴ int64 b⦆ → int64 ⟦
    int64 sum ↦ a ⊕ b ·
    yield sum ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    int64 x ↦ 10 ·
    int64 y ↦ 32 ·
    int64 res ↦ calculate⦅x ⸴ y⦆ ·
    emit res ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧
